OL,3,GNEWSACharity warns about damage of
OL,4,Aover-foraging fungi
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe impacts of over-foraging natural
OL,7,Fspaces, particularly in protected
OL,8,Fareas, can damage habitats, a Devon
OL,9,Fcharity has said.
OL,11,FThe Woodland Trust said unsustainable
OL,12,Fharvesting of plants - and particularly
OL,13,Ffungi - could put wildlife under
OL,14,Fpressure.
OL,16,FJoe Middleton, site manager for the
OL,17,FWoodland Trust, said he had seen
OL,18,Fcommercial mushroom pickers "wiping out
OL,19,Feverything on the path edges they can
OL,20,Ffind".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
