OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1793706979
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSACharity warns about damage of
OL,4,Aover-foraging fungi
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder Section 4 of the Theft Act 1968,
OL,7,Fit is "perfectly legal to forage for
OL,8,Ffruit, foliage, flowers, and fungi on
OL,9,Fany land, provided they are wild and
OL,10,Fcollected strictly for personal use",
OL,11,Fbut "foraging becomes criminal theft if
OL,12,Fyou pick wild plants for commercial
OL,13,Fsale or reward without permission".
